<title>USA: Corvas says Schering to develop drug.</title>
<headline>Corvas says Schering to develop drug.</headline>
<dateline>SAN DIEGO 1997-01-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Corvas International Inc said Schering-Plough Corp selected one of Corvas' orally-active thrombin inhibitors to develop as a treatment for chronic diseases caused by abnormal blood clot formation.</p>
<p>Corvas will receive a payment of $3 million from Schering-Plough for this key milestone, the company said.</p>
</text>
